=Student check-in:
- Name: {{ $json.name }}
- Stress level (1-10): {{ $json.stressLevelNum }}
- Hours of sleep last night: {{ $json.sleepHoursNum }}
- Workload (1-10): {{ $json.workloadNum }}
- Upcoming deadlines: {{ $json.deadlinesNum }}
- Calculated stress category: {{ $json.stressCategory }}
- How they feel: "{{ $json.feeling }}"
- Escalation flag (very high stress or signs of being seriously overwhelmed): {{ $json.escalate }}

Write short, warm, practical advice for this student.

